    "synopsis": {
        "native": "Dr\u017eava je odlu\u010dila stati na kraj udovicama hrvatskih branitelja koje \u017eive u izvanbra\u010dnim zajednicama, a primaju mirovine pokojnih mu\u017eeva. Za hvatanje udovica u prijestupu na teren \u0161alju potpuno pogre\u0161nog \u010dovjeka, nezaposlenog biologa Kre\u0161u, posrnula samopouzdanja i u bra\u010dnoj krizi. Stvari se dodatno zakompliciraju kada se zaljubi u jednu od udovica.",
        "english": "Film portrait of the Turkish painter G\u00fcler Y\u00fccel (1935-2020), wife of the political poet Can Y\u00fccel (1926-1999). Her paintings show weddings and funerals, she painted her husband and herself. In a way, her paintings tell of the cycle of life, for example, when she captures the annual almond blossom and the traditional olive harvest - all things from her own everyday life: \"I can't paint anything I haven't seen,\" says Y\u00fccel."
